msgid ""
"Override the saved date and time of the last synchronisation. Only invoices "
"changed after this date and time of change will be retrieved. Format: YYYY-"
"MM-DD HH:MM:SS (e.g., 2024-10-28 15:45:00). If not provided, the date from "
"the last successful synchronization will be used."
